        <div>1. We declare that this invoice shows the actual price of the goods described and that all particulars are true and correct.</div>
        <div style="margin-top:2px">2. Interest Rate @ 24% p.a. will be charged if payment is not done on or before due date.</div>
        <div style="margin-top:2px">3. No claim will be accepted after 15 days from invoice date.</div>
